OL,3,GNEWSA'Troubled hotel targeted' and
OL,4,A'TikTok trends sees spike in
OL,5,Atresspasses'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHere's our weekly roundup of stories
OL,8,Ffrom across local websites in the West
OL,9,Fof England.
OL,11,FParts of south Bristol have been
OL,12,Fplagued with anti-social behaviour as
OL,13,FTikTok trends have encouraged teenagers
OL,14,Fto trespass into empty buildings,
OL,15,FBristol Live is reporting.
OL,17,FPeople in Stroud are "outraged" after
OL,18,Ffruit trees at a hospital were axed to
OL,19,Fmake room for a car park expansion,
OL,20,Freports Gloucestershire Live.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
