OL,3,GNEWSA'Troubled hotel targeted' and
OL,4,A'TikTok trends sees spike in
OL,5,Atresspasses'
OL,6,
OL,7,FFurther action is to be taken to stop
OL,8,Fpeople breaking into the Grand Atlantic
OL,9,FHotel in Weston-super-Mare. Ongoing
OL,10,Fsecurity problems at the vacant site
OL,11,Fwill be tackled with higher fencing,
OL,12,Fanti-vandal paint and new legal powers
OL,13,Ffor police to take stronger enforcement
OL,14,Faction against trespassers.
